<rich_text weight="heavy">Additional Telemetry &amp; Detection Opportunities</rich_text>
<rich_text>
</rich_text>
<rich_text style="italic" foreground="#8a8d96">missing telemetry, Sigma or YARA rules, API hook points worth intercepting</rich_text>
